heading:"Contribute information",texts_content_contribute_text:"If you yourself know restaurants, cafes, ice cream parlors or food kiosks that are not yet on the map, or run one yourself, then you can simply add them yourself. To do this, you have to mark the venue in OpenStreetMap with the 'diet:vegan' or 'diet:vegetarian' tag (\"Diet Types\"). Instructions are available <a href='how-to/tutorial_en.html' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>here</a>.",texts_content_reviews_heading:"Reviews",texts_content_reviews_text:"<a href='https://lib.reviews/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>lib.reviews</a> is a free and open platform for reviewing anything. If there is a review of a place there, we will show a link to it.",texts_content_further_heading:"Further",texts_content_further_text:"Veggiekarte is updated automatically every hour. You can find the code on <a href='https://codeberg.org/piratenpanda/veggiekarte' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>Codeberg</a>.",texts_i18n_vegan_only:"vegan only",texts_i18n_vegan_only_title:"Place which offers exclusively vegan food.",texts_i18n_vegetarian_only:"vegetarian and vegan only",texts_i18n_vegetarian_only_title:"Place which offers exclusively vegetarian and vegan food.",texts_i18n_vegan_friendly:"vegan friendly",texts_i18n_vegan_friendly_title:"Place which offers also vegan food.",texts_i18n_vegan_limited:"vegan limited",texts_i18n_vegan_limited_title:"Place with limited vegan offer (often you have to ask for it outside the menu).",texts_i18n_vegetarian_friendly:"vegetarian friendly",texts_i18n_vegetarian_friendly_title:"Place which offers also vegetarian food, but no vegan.",category_selection_title:"Selection",category_diet_types:"Diet Types",category_categories:"Categories",category_food_only:"Food Only",category_food_only_hint:"Show only food & drinks",category_show_all:"Show All",category_show_all_hint:"Show all categories",category_reset:"↺ Reset",category_reset_hint:"Reset to default settings",catego